UNDERSANDED  HELP

The Undersanded is a place of pressure and patience. Read the current before
you commit the hook, and keep one eye on your Hull.


At the dock: [R]efine, [U]pgrade, [C]raft, [B]uy, [E]quip, [T] Rest,
[D]epart, [Q]uit. [Esc] saves and [?] opens this page.


Every creature you release is one you may meet again; surface with what you
can carry, not what you wish you had taken.

















